# Build and packaging

## Commands

| Script | Output |
|--------|--------|
| `npm test` | Ava unit tests |
| `npm run build:firefox` | `dist-firefox/` (MV2) |
| `npm run build:chrome` | `dist-chrome/` (MV3) |
| `npm run package:firefox` | `artifacts/*.xpi` |
| `npm run package:chrome` | `artifacts/*-chrome.zip` |
| `npm run build` | Both browser builds |

## Version

Bump **`version` in `src/manifest.shared.json`** (single source). Both manifests inherit it.

## Invariants

- Content-script export strip (`scripts/strip-content-script-export.mjs`) must run after `tsc`
- Shared TS under `src/`; never fork logic per browser unless API-required
- Load steps: see `BUILD.md`. Operational skill: `build-extension`
